# Purpose
Documents how node-local private video metadata can augment the public video
catalogue without committing access-control values to the public repo.

# Key Files
- `README.md`

# Dependencies
- `../index.json` uses `embed_hash_ref` values that private overlays can
  resolve.

# Gotchas
- Do not commit real overlay files with real Vimeo hashes to the public repo.

# Change History
- 2026-08-03: Created private overlay guidance.
